<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram id="p_01_csi_vs_rssi" name="01-csi-vs-rssi"><mxGraphModel dx="800" dy="600" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1280" pageHeight="840" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="title" value="CSI keeps the per-subcarrier fingerprint that RSSI averages away - and a moving body changes only the dynamic paths" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="12" width="1240" height="34" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="room" value="A room, seen from above (schematic, not to scale) [A1]" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fbfbfb;strokeColor=#999999;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="62" width="620" height="440" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="wall" value="wall / furniture = STATIC reflector" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;fillColor=#eeeeee;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="120" y="96" width="420" height="16" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="tx" value="Transmitter (AP)&#10;sends known&#10;training symbols" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="250" width="120" height="62" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rx" value="Receiver (device)&#10;estimates H per&#10;subcarrier" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="500" y="250" width="130" height="62" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="person" value="person&#10;moves" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="395" width="56" height="80" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="los_lbl" value="line of sight (static)" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;fillColor=#fbfbfb;strokeColor=#fbfbfb;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="250" y="258" width="150" height="20" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="wall_lbl" value="reflected path&#10;(static)" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;fontSize=10;fillColor=#fbfbfb;strokeColor=#fbfbfb;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="458" y="126" width="150" height="34" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="dyn_lbl" value="reflected path&#10;(DYNAMIC: its length&#10;changes as she moves)" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#fbfbfb;strokeColor=#fbfbfb;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="440" width="150" height="48" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="model" value="The channel at subcarrier frequency f is the sum of all paths [A1; Ma et al. 2019]:&#10;      H(f) = Σᵢ aᵢ · exp(−j 2π f τᵢ)  =  H_static(f) + H_dynamic(f, t)&#10;Each path rotates by a different angle at each f, so paths add up differently per subcarrier (frequency-selective fading). Motion changes only H_dynamic: amplitude and phase fluctuate (CARM, Wang et al. 2015)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;fontSize=12;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="514" width="620" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="csi_panel" value="CSI: one complex value per subcarrier per antenna pair, every frame" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="680" y="62" width="570" height="300" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="csi_cap" value="Bars = |H| per subcarrier (schematic shape, no data). Grey = frame before, red dashed = frame after the person moved: the fingerprint changes shape. Subcarriers 312.5 kHz apart [1]; 52 used at 20 MHz legacy [2], 56 in 802.11n HT20 [3]; a 2x2 link has 4 antenna pairs [4], each with its own row." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="690" y="300" width="550" height="58" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rssi_panel" value="RSSI: one power number per frame" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="680" y="376" width="570" height="126" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rssi_a" value="frame before:&#10;one number" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="410" width="160" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rssi_b" value="frame after:&#10;nearly the same" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=11;dashed=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="410" width="160" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rssi_cap" value="Power summed over the whole channel. Two different motions can give the same RSSI change and different CSI changes [A1]." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1050" y="400" width="195" height="98" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="timing" value="How fast it fluctuates [A1]: one cycle per wavelength of path change; wavelength 12.3 cm at 2.4 GHz [5], 5.5 cm at 5 GHz [6]. A reflected path changes at up to 2x body speed, so a 1 m/s walk gives up to ~36 Hz at 5 GHz [7] (Doppler).&#10;CAUTION: beacon-driven CSI at an illustrative 10 Hz [8] cannot represent anything above 5 Hz (Nyquist, my arithmetic): you see aliased energy, not a clean Doppler spectrum." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="680" y="514" width="570" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" value="Legend:  blue = radios | red, red dashed = dynamic (motion-dependent) | grey = static | purple = model | green frame = CSI (PHY-layer detail) | amber = RSSI and timing caveat.&#10;[A1], [A2] = kit notes. [n] = constants.json entry listed below; ILLUSTRATIVE values are round teaching values, never measurements." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="636" width="1220" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="bb0" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;fillColor=#cccccc;strokeColor=#999999;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="712" y="217" width="26" height="75" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ba0" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;dashed=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="718" y="204" width="26" height="87" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="bb1" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;fillColor=#cccccc;strokeColor=#999999;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="752" y="173" width="26" height="118" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ba1" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;dashed=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="758" y="192" width="26" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="bb2" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;fillColor=#cccccc;strokeColor=#999999;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="792" y="129" width="26" height="162" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ba2" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;dashed=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="798" y="167" width="26" height="125" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="bb3" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;fillColor=#cccccc;strokeColor=#999999;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="832" y="160" width="26" height="131" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ba3" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;dashed=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="838" y="135" width="26" height="156" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="bb4" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;fillColor=#cccccc;strokeColor=#999999;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="872" y="223" width="26" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ba4" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;dashed=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="878" y="185" width="26" height="106" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="bb5" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;fillColor=#cccccc;strokeColor=#999999;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="912" y="254" width="26" height="37" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ba5" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;dashed=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="918" y="242" width="26" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="bb6" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;fillColor=#cccccc;strokeColor=#999999;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="952" y="232" width="26" height="60" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ba6" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;dashed=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="958" y="254" width="26" height="37" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="bb7" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;fillColor=#cccccc;strokeColor=#999999;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="992" y="167" width="26" height="125" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ba7" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;dashed=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="998" y="204" width="26" height="87" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="bb8" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;fillColor=#cccccc;strokeColor=#999999;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1032" y="104" width="26" height="187" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ba8" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;dashed=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1038" y="142" width="26" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="bb9" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;fillColor=#cccccc;strokeColor=#999999;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1072" y="92" width="26" height="200" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ba9" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;dashed=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1078" y="85" width="26" height="206" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="bb10" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;fillColor=#cccccc;strokeColor=#999999;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1112" y="148" width="26" height="143" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ba10" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;dashed=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1118" y="117" width="26" height="175" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="bb11" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;fillColor=#cccccc;strokeColor=#999999;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1152" y="202" width="26" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ba11" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;dashed=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1158" y="173" width="26" height="118" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="bb12" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;fillColor=#cccccc;strokeColor=#999999;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1192" y="242" width="26" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ba12" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;dashed=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1198" y="223" width="26" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="axis_lbl" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;fillColor=#333333;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="291" width="540" height="2" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="src" value="Numbers (all loaded from constants.json):&#10;[1] ofdm_subcarrier_spacing_11a_n_ac - public; IEEE 802.11 OFDM PHY (clauses 17/19/21): 20 MHz / 64-point FFT&#10;[2] used_subcarriers_legacy_20MHz - public; IEEE 802.11a/g OFDM PHY&#10;[3] used_subcarriers_ht_20MHz - public; IEEE 802.11n HT20&#10;[4] mimo_2x2_streams - public; my arithmetic: 2 TX x 2 RX antennas&#10;[5] wavelength_2g4 - public; my arithmetic: speed_of_light / 2.437 GHz (channel 6)&#10;[6] wavelength_5g - public; my arithmetic: speed_of_light / 5.5 GHz (mid 5 GHz band)&#10;[7] doppler_walk_example_5g - public; my arithmetic: reflected path length changes at up to 2 x 1 m/s for an illustrative 1 m/s walk; f = 2 / wavelength_5g&#10;[8] csi_rate_beacon_illustrative - ILLUSTRATIVE; round value for passive beacon-driven CSI; consistent with beacon_rate_default; internal I2/I7 report the same order&#10;Notes: [A1] CSI and multipath (OFDM, CSI vs RSSI, static/dynamic paths, Doppler, Nyquist caution); [A2] what the hardware gives you. Public refs: IEEE 802.11 OFDM PHY; Ma, Zhou, Wang, CSUR 2019; Wang et al. MobiCom 2015 (CARM); Qian et al. 2017 (Widar/WiDance Doppler)." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=9;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="694" width="1220" height="132" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="line0" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=0;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="170" y="281" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="500" y="281" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="line1" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=0;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=1.5;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="130" y="250" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="330" y="112" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="line2" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=0;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=1.5;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="330" y="112" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="545" y="250" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="line3" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=0;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="150" y="312" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="300" y="432" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="line4" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=0;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="356" y="432" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="520" y="312" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>